// Azure Speech calls by operation (DIAAT-282). Recording pipeline (Phase 2): Speech.
//
// Measure: volume, latency and failures of each kind of batch HTTP call to Azure Speech.
// Formula: per speech.operation: calls = sum(valueCount) of the duration histogram;
//   avg_ms = 1000 * sum(valueSum) / calls; max_ms = 1000 * max(valueMax);
//   failures = sum of transcription.speech.call.failures; failure % = 100 * failures /
//   calls; throttled = sum of transcription.speech.throttled (HTTP 429).
// Source: transcription.speech.call.duration (histogram, s), .call.failures and
//   transcription.speech.throttled (counters), emitted only by the recording batch
//   client (transcribe-api for submissions, transcribe-api-worker for polling), so no
//   area filter: metric dimensions do not carry hmcts.area (decision 1). Operations:
//   speech.submit, speech.status, speech.results, speech.delete, speech.model. Never
//   sampled (OD2).
// Caveats: a failure is a 4xx/5xx or a transport error; a 404 on delete is success.
//   Each retry attempt is its own call. No percentiles: App Insights stores only
//   count/sum/min/max of a histogram. Dictation's live Speech sessions are not here.
customMetrics
| where name in ("transcription.speech.call.duration", "transcription.speech.call.failures", "transcription.speech.throttled")
| extend operation = tostring(customDimensions["speech.operation"])
| summarize
    calls = sumif(valueCount, name == "transcription.speech.call.duration"),
    total_s = sumif(valueSum, name == "transcription.speech.call.duration"),
    max_s = maxif(valueMax, name == "transcription.speech.call.duration"),
    failures = sumif(value, name == "transcription.speech.call.failures"),
    throttled = sumif(value, name == "transcription.speech.throttled")
    by operation
| extend
    avg_ms = round(iff(calls > 0, 1000.0 * total_s / calls, real(null)), 0),
    max_ms = round(1000.0 * max_s, 0),
    failure_pct = round(iff(calls > 0, 100.0 * failures / calls, real(null)), 2)
| project operation, calls, avg_ms, max_ms, failures, failure_pct, throttled
| order by calls desc
